Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.89,0:20:17.15,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}A sunny Sunday's early afternoon;
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.15,0:20:20.53,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}where should we go today?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.32,0:20:26.91,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}The same old road that I'm so used to walking on...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.91,0:20:32.00,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}...shines with a dazzling light.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.71,0:20:36.63,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}If I have the warm sunlight shining down on me...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.88,0:20:41.92,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}...and you by my side...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.72,0:20:52.06,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}My feelings are ready to burst forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.39,0:20:57.15,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}Sing out, lai lai lai!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.15,0:21:02.36,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}My voice reaches every corner of the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.65,0:21:07.57,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}I'm already high, high, high!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.57,0:21:13.20,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}Riding the whirling winds...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.20,0:21:17.58,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}Sing out, lai lai lai!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.00,0:21:23.51,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}My voice swoops up and down with me.
