Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.75,0:19:13.71,Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\b1\bord9\fs15\frz347.196\3c&HC1E1F3&\pos(655,155)\c&H2E455F&}Happy birthday, Rin-chan
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.27,0:02:47.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Saionji-sensei...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.60,0:02:52.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You should go and get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.90,0:02:54.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.23,0:02:59.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, if I sleep now, we'll never make the deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.45,0:03:01.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.74,0:03:04.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...don't we go outside for some fresh air?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.45,0:03:06.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're taking a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.62,0:03:08.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.00,0:03:09.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.83,0:03:11.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You guys should get some rest if you need it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.13,0:03:16.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If anything happens, call my cell phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.26,0:03:21.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll be pretty much fine for tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.30,0:03:23.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.58,0:03:55.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.50,0:04:00.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's so hot...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.68,0:04:05.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your hand feels like ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.51,0:04:07.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You shouldn't keep your room so cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.05,0:04:12.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But if I turn off the air conditioning, you guys sweat all over the manuscripts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.81,0:04:15.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've heard that stress can cause your body temperature to fall, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.06,0:04:17.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.12,0:04:31.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, about that new job you were mentioning recently...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.16,0:04:37.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think it's worth taking if it'll cause a drop in the quality of your current work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.50,0:04:43.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've never been very strong, physically or mentally, Maa-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.88,0:04:46.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And you're just now making enough to put food on your plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.47,0:04:48.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So I don't think there's any need to get greedy with money.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.26,0:04:49.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.60,0:04:50.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.64,0:04:55.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The public's current interest in my work could easily disappear come next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.81,0:05:00.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's always a new generation of artists hitting the scene...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.32,0:05:06.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And people can grow bored with your work just like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.41,0:05:10.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're way too pessimistic, Maa-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.78,0:05:12.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.50,0:05:16.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You have ink on your face again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.62,0:05:17.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.54,0:05:21.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Geez...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.92,0:05:25.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're a girl, so you should really{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.34,0:05:30.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.55,0:05:32.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a manga artist!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.56,0:05:36.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going home to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.81,0:05:43.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry to bother you all...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.36,0:05:46.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Geez...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.20,0:05:50.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't be bothered to go to work...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.70,0:05:57.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.75,0:05:58.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.25,0:06:01.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why didn't you come out when I called you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.38,0:06:05.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry. It's too hot...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.26,0:06:07.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Does that cool you down?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.63,0:06:08.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.26,0:06:13.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shall we make your lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.51,0:06:14.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.11,0:06:30.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, give me a hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.07,0:06:33.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.08,0:06:37.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin's summer holidays have started.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.96,0:06:40.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We make her lunch together in the morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.14,0:06:42.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and then she goes to a daycare centre.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.50,0:06:47.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want to visit Granddad's grave next Saturday?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.88,0:06:50.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's almost time for the Bon Festival,\Nafter all, and your flowers should be...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.88,0:06:52.26,Note,,0000,0000,0000,,TL Note: A Japanese holiday when it is customary to honour the deceased spirits of your ancestors.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.74,0:06:52.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.26,0:06:54.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong? You don't want to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.97,0:06:58.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The bellflowers haven't bloomed yet, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.31,0:07:03.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, right. I guess they'll take a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.44,0:07:09.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then how about we buy some from a florist this time? We'll take yours once they've bloomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.53,0:07:10.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.37,0:07:18.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's true that Granddad would be happy if you brought him bellflowers that you grew.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.95,0:07:21.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.92,0:07:26.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But just having you there would make him the happiest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.34,0:07:29.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's the most important thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.92,0:07:32.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.09,0:07:33.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.48,0:07:46.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If Rin weren't here, I doubt I'd be thinking of Granddad like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.98,0:07:50.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan! Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.53,0:07:52.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, Kouki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.20,0:07:56.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! You'll mess it all up if you move!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.53,0:07:57.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.45,0:08:01.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why is your hair so fine, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.75,0:08:02.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.76,0:08:14.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.55,0:08:17.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.43,0:08:19.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, we're going to be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.89,0:08:24.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.14,0:08:27.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, how many more days?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.82,0:08:34.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,About ten, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.45,0:08:36.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Found one!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.62,0:08:39.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A cicada shell!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.45,0:08:40.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A shell?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.08,0:08:45.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Man, this is nostalgic...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.29,0:08:49.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've got a ton of them in here...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.84,0:08:52.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.26,0:08:54.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop shaking them!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.80,0:08:57.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're going to be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.93,0:09:01.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.64,0:09:04.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look out for cars!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.56,0:09:10.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've been here lots of times.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.94,0:09:12.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,With Granddad?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.28,0:09:13.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.07,0:09:17.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really? I guess Granny's grave is here too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.49,0:09:19.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Granddad's granny?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.28,0:09:21.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.33,0:09:26.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Granny and Granddad had a child, my mum.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.71,0:09:28.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And then, she had me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.96,0:09:32.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah! So your mum is Granddad's daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.67,0:09:34.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.01,0:09:38.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That means I'm your mother's sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.26,0:09:42.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Crap! I shouldn't have pointed her in that direction!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.81,0:09:45.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.94,0:09:48.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.57,0:09:55.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's all wet...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.41,0:10:05.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That vase...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.29,0:10:09.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Masako-san had one just like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.29,0:10:12.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ma...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.30,0:10:21.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell? But she didn't even come to the funeral...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.22,0:10:25.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.39,0:10:26.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.35,0:10:28.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait here for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.94,0:10:33.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pull out some of the weeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.02,0:10:34.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.42,0:10:57.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.59,0:11:01.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who goes to visit a grave with a guy, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.44,0:11:12.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,W-Woof!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.28,0:11:26.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?! What are you doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.16,0:11:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought you were some sort of stalker...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.25,0:11:31.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We happened to come to the graveyard after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.75,0:11:33.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It was really just a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.79,0:11:36.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I thought I should let you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.92,0:11:40.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...that Rin's here with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.88,0:11:43.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's at Granddad's grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.01,0:11:48.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.90,0:11:56.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin's very dear to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.02,0:11:58.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,so I don't really think very fondly of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.36,0:12:01.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and I don't really care about what's going on in your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.53,0:12:06.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have no intention of forcing the two of you to meet again, unless she wants it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.53,0:12:08.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.16,0:12:14.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What did you want to tell me so badly that you chased after me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.04,0:12:19.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to ask if you wanted to at least secretly get a look at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.05,0:12:25.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're going to clean the grave, light some incense and go home,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.14,0:12:28.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,so we'll probably be around for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.47,0:12:31.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, Rin's waiting for me. I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.02,0:12:38.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.57,0:12:41.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll just be doing what we came here to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.62,0:12:55.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin... Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.33,0:12:56.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Were you waiting long?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.55,0:13:07.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.43,0:13:10.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.68,0:13:12.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um... I had something to...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.98,0:13:13.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.85,0:13:15.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.56,0:13:16.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Were you waiting long?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.60,0:13:18.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.27,0:13:20.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Were you lonely?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.15,0:13:23.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're being weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.69,0:13:26.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you getting so worked up for?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.11,0:13:29.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not being weird...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.49,0:13:31.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.49,0:13:32.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.91,0:13:34.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Plant them there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.45,0:13:35.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.17,0:13:48.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's not a baby any more...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.47,0:13:53.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Blood ties are amazing...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.47,0:13:56.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know. She looks just like you, Maa-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.94,0:13:59.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That back...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.10,0:14:01.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's pretty cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.19,0:14:04.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That sense of distance...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.78,0:14:07.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's so much like Souichi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.71,0:14:17.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so glad...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.25,0:14:22.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That was really a shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.59,0:14:25.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess coincidences like this only pop up when it's almost Obon, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.47,0:14:30.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She turns seven today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.14,0:14:31.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.60,0:14:34.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Learning about your daughter was a shock, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.38,0:14:36.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but I thought maybe the guy was your ex-boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.64,0:14:38.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.60,0:14:42.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He doesn't have a single brain cell in that head of his.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.99,0:14:53.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Though that could change in another half-century.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.24,0:14:57.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Half... century?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.04,0:15:04.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's logical to assume that that guy was her boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.75,0:15:07.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi? You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.09,0:15:09.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess it's not such a bad thing, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.18,0:15:11.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.51,0:15:16.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For someone madly in love, it didn't\Ntake her long to find somebody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.35,0:15:17.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.64,0:15:19.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.56,0:15:22.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can we go to Granddad's?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.60,0:15:24.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's close by, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.61,0:15:29.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hm... But it's not Granddad's house any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.03,0:15:31.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is somebody living there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.74,0:15:35.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, nobody's living there, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.24,0:15:40.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It belongs to my uncle on my mother's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.62,0:15:42.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Buddhist altar is there too, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.71,0:15:46.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.01,0:15:54.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fine, I'll ask my uncle if we can at least take a look around the garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.80,0:15:55.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.22,0:15:57.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just the garden!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.72,0:15:58.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.85,0:16:00.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.86,0:16:11.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to take them up on that job, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.57,0:16:13.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.07,0:16:16.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Will you be okay, Maa-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.16,0:16:19.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I gave her up for the sake of my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.95,0:16:21.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I should be doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.83,0:16:23.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You already are!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.79,0:16:26.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're working harder than anyone needs to!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.84,0:16:28.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.17,0:16:32.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I need to work so hard that I can't even\Nremember what I had for dinner the night before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.84,0:16:36.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, come on. Even I forget that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.60,0:16:38.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If I don't do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.18,0:16:41.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If I don't forget all of those things...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.64,0:16:42.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.94,0:16:52.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just a little further!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.63,0:17:12.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's just the same as it used to be, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.55,0:17:17.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But you've changed so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.90,0:17:37.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.28,0:17:38.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The bellflowers are gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.57,0:17:40.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The dirt is gone, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.20,0:17:45.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Those bellflowers were so important to Granddad...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.00,0:17:50.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure he didn't mean to just yank them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.17,0:17:55.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even my uncle could tell you Granddad's favourite flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.76,0:17:59.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But when Winter comes, they wither.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.59,0:18:03.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He probably didn't know that they bloom again in Spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.14,0:18:07.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And these stones...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.89,0:18:10.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't spread them around,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.62,0:18:13.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,the area will become overrun with weeds before you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.65,0:18:21.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so glad we got Rin's fragrant olive tree out...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.37,0:18:22.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That was lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.33,0:18:32.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But luckily, we have bellflowers for Granddad at our house, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.71,0:18:36.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So we're okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.93,0:18:40.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.31,0:18:48.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe things changing isn't always a bad thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.60,0:18:52.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But that grave will always be Granddad's grave, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.77,0:18:53.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.37,0:19:03.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.58,0:19:04.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.20,0:19:10.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Happy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.37,0:19:13.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A chocolate cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.38,0:19:20.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Saionji-sensei, can you do a final check?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.97,0:19:23.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.14,0:19:27.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You really seem like you're pushing yourself too hard this time...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.52,0:19:31.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When you say things like that, my hands stop working properly, so stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.07,0:19:45.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.79,0:19:53.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll finish it, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.82,0:21:47.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! All of the nighttime stalls are going to close!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.28,0:21:49.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, they won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.95,0:21:53.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just like Granddad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.00,0:21:58.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here's Kouki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.00,0:22:04.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.13,0:22:05.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We were supposed to be meeting at the shrine, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.88,0:22:07.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mum's too slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.93,0:22:09.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're not wearing a yukata?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.89,0:22:11.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't jump in one!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.10,0:22:14.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Awesome, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.10,0:22:17.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What about your mum?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.89,0:22:20.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She said she'd meet us at the shrine after she put on her yukata.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.32,0:22:30.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go! The nighttime stalls will close!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.79,0:22:38.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, look out for cars!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.87,0:22:39.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.99,0:22:42.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait! It's hard to run in wooden clogs!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.69,0:22:43.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll carry you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.48,0:22:44.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.52,0:22:45.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can carry me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.81,0:22:47.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No!
